{"id":"practice:co-fermentation","layer":"reference","name":"Co-fermentation (grape-stage assemblage)","status":"active","summary":"Vinifying two or more varieties together from the grape stage rather than blending finished wines. Several Northern Rhône specifications describe this at the grape stage; it does not tell you what an individual producer did in a given vintage.","type":"practice"}
